Rulith app (formerly Deep Rulith)
Copyright 2026 Shanghai Rulith Technology Co., Ltd.

The Rulith app is an overlay and a set of plugins for DeepSeek Harness (dsh,
https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness, MIT License). This package does
not include or modify dsh's code: npm installs dsh and its dependencies from their
publishers, each under its own license.

What npm installs with rulith 0.19.0 (about 635 packages on Windows x64, counted
2026-10-25; other platforms differ in their platform-specific packages):

- DeepSeek Harness, about 290 packages under @deepseek-ai: MIT, except
  @deepseek-ai/node-addon-system (BSD-3-Clause) and @deepseek-ai/libreoffice-kit
  with its platform package (MPL-2.0; a prebuilt LibreOffice for dsh's document
  previews, which the Rulith app turns off).
- Third-party packages: MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC, BSD-3-Clause, BSD-2-Clause, 0BSD,
  Unlicense, Python-2.0 (argparse) and MIT OR CC0-1.0 (type-fest), and
  @img/sharp-<platform> (Apache-2.0 AND LGPL-3.0-or-later: the prebuilt libvips
  image library).

None of them is modified by this package.

